cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20669797
title: "AFSD Predictor: peak-temperature and processing-map calculator for Additive Friction Stir Deposition"
abstract: >-
  A desktop application that computes the peak contact temperature of the
  Additive Friction Stir Deposition (AFSD) process and builds 2D/3D processing
  maps with stability windows, using a force-controlled self-consistent thermal
  model for shoulderless and shouldered (MELD) configurations.
type: software
